<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR STARTS DOWN AT $80-3/8 IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR STARTS DOWN AT $80-3/8 IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened down $0-3/4 at $80-3/8 in New York on Thursday.</p>
<p>The price corresponded to about 417.6 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
